      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    fund_value = 100_000_000\n    current_stock_weight = 0.80\n    target_stock_weight = 0.60\n    stock_beta = 1.20\n    futures_beta = 0.95\n    index_level = 1_200\n    contract_multiplier = 250\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    stock_value_to_reduce = fund_value * (current_stock_weight - target_stock_weight)\n    futures_contract_value = index_level * contract_multiplier\n    beta_adjusted_contract_value = futures_contract_value * futures_beta\n    number_of_futures = (\n        stock_value_to_reduce * stock_beta\n    ) / beta_adjusted_contract_value\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(number_of_futures, 3)\n```",
